. * ==== VERIFY CONTRACT ====
. * skill:    stata-regression
. * chapter:  ch10.11
. * data:     sim:40x6
. * checks:   xtabond+xtdpdsys+dynamic-panel-diagnostics
. * =========================
. 
. display "DYNAMIC_PANEL_CONTRACT_REQUIRED"
DYNAMIC_PANEL_CONTRACT_REQUIRED

. clear

. set seed 20260910

. set obs 40
Number of observations (_N) was 0, now 40.

. gen id = _n

. expand 6
(200 observations created)

. bysort id: gen t = _n

. xtset id t

Panel variable: id (strongly balanced)
 Time variable: t, 1 to 6
         Delta: 1 unit

. gen u = rnormal()

. gen x = rnormal()

. gen y = .
(240 missing values generated)

. sort id t

. by id: replace y = u if t == 1
(40 real changes made)

. by id: replace y = 0.55 * y[_n-1] + 0.35 * x + u if t > 1
(200 real changes made)

. 
